  "title": "Johannes Gutenberg",
  "summary": "Johannes Gutenberg (born Johann Gensfleisch zur Laden) was born around 1398 in Mainz and trained there as a goldsmith. After years in Strasbourg he had a printing operation by 1450, funded by a loan from Johann Fust; Fust sued and the partnership was dissolved in 1455. He died in Mainz in 1468.",
