      "end_plus_years": 0,
      "note": "Encyclopedia.com gives \"around 1398\"; the Gutenberg-Gesellschaft page gives no birth date, so the +/- range is an editorial estimate of doubt. The Gesellschaft says a document of 26 February 1468 records his death and that the date 3 February may be invented."
